# Expo + Tamagui

## Do
- Expo SDK 57, Expo Router tabs
- Scheme: `openrouter-mobile`
- Tamagui: `createTamagui` from `tamagui`, `defaultConfig` from `@tamagui/config/v5`
- Effect HTTP: `expo/fetch` for FetchHttpClient
- WebSocket: `binaryType = "arraybuffer"`

## Do not
- Nested `File` in RPC payloads (no HTTP upload route; media jobs are stubs; `AudioTranscribe` takes a string `assetId`)
- Import `apps/server` from the mobile app

Read `.cursor/skills/expo-tamagui/SKILL.md`.
